# Repository Structure

**Project**: Enterprise Policy Assistant (RAG-Based)

> **📖 Single Source of Truth**: For complete and up-to-date repository structure, see [docs/12_repository_structure.md](../../docs/12_repository_structure.md)

## Quick Reference

**Key Directories:**

- `src/frontend/` - React.js 19 with TypeScript (Presentation Layer)
- `src/backend/` - FastAPI REST API (Application Layer)
- `infra/` - Infrastructure configuration (Qdrant, PostgreSQL; Podman-compatible)
- `docs/` - Project documentation

**Key Entry Points:**

- `src/frontend/src/main.tsx` - Frontend entry point
- `src/backend/app/main.py` - Backend entry point (FastAPI app)
- `infra/docker-compose.yml` - Qdrant + PostgreSQL (Podman-compatible)
